      "finding": "Normalization alone exposed clearly visible repeated self-shadow stripes in the sunlit wet-road highlight. In the receiver-plane capture those stripes are no longer apparent; the highlight remains. The independently captured full-benchmark front view was also personally viewed and shows the same improvement."
