    },
    {
      "view": "wet-low",
      "finding": "The viewed corrected frame retains vertex-color triangles, nearby wet-surface reflections, glass and emission. This single static image does not establish motion stability."
    },
    {
      "view": "10000-static-three-way",
      "finding": "The actual full-benchmark Engine, Three and Babylon r0 PNGs were personally viewed. Object layout matches, but fog/sky, illumination, contrast and edge smoothing visibly differ. These are distinct native pipelines; this review does not establish an equal-quality winner."
